sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as ODH Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ModuleOp as MCP Lifecycle<br/>Module Operator
    participant OSAPI as OpenShift APIServer<br/>(config.openshift.io)
    participant Operand as MCP Lifecycle Operator<br/>(Operand Deployment)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over PlatformOp,Operand: Flow 1: Operand Deployment

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>(managementState: Managed)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Watch event: CR created<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    ModuleOp->>OSAPI: GET config.openshift.io/apiservers<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    OSAPI-->>ModuleOp: TLS Profile (ciphers, minVersion)

    Note over ModuleOp: Render embedded kustomize manifests<br/>via manifestival:<br/>- Inject platform.opendatahub.io/part-of label<br/>- Set target namespace<br/>- Replace operand image<br/>- Inject TLS env vars

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: SSA Apply: MCPServer CRD<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: SSA Apply: RBAC (7 resources)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: SSA Apply: ServiceAccount<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: SSA Apply: Deployment<br/>(with TLS_MIN_VERSION, TLS_CIPHER_SUITES)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: SSA Apply: Service (metrics 8443)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: SSA Apply: ServiceMonitor<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: SSA Apply: NetworkPolicy<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    K8sAPI-->>Operand: Deployment created/updated

    Note over PlatformOp,Operand: Flow 2: Garbage Collection

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: List resources by label<br/>platform.opendatahub.io/part-of=mcplifecycleoperator<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Labeled resources list

    Note over ModuleOp: Compare labeled resources<br/>against desired set.<br/>Delete any not in desired set.

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Delete stale resources<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    Note over PlatformOp,Operand: Flow 3: Readiness Monitoring

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Watch operand Deployment<br/>(label-filtered)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Deployment status updates
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Update MCPLifecycleOperator status<br/>(conditions, releases)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    Note over PlatformOp,Operand: Flow 4: Metrics Scraping

    Prometheus->>Operand: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Operand-->>Prometheus: Metrics response

    Note over PlatformOp,Operand: Flow 5: Operand Removal

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Update MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>(managementState: Removed)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Watch event: CR updated
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Delete all owned resources<br/>(by label selector)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
